<section class="intro"><h2>Как выполнять задания</h2><p>Прочитай инструкцию к каждому заданию. Когда будешь готов, нажми «Начать запись» и выполни задание. После выполнения всех четырёх заданий скачай аудиозаписи и отправь их учителю.</p><div style="margin-top:14px"><label for="student"><strong>Имя и фамилия</strong></label><br><input id="student" class="name-field" placeholder="Например, Anna Ivanova" autocomplete="name"></div><div class="notice-box">Для записи разреши браузеру использовать микрофон. На телефоне и компьютере лучше пользоваться наушниками. Не закрывай страницу, пока не скачаешь записи. Для работы микрофона сайт обычно должен быть открыт по HTTPS или локально.</div></section>
<section class="task"><div class="task-title"><div class="number">1</div><h2>Task 1 · Reading aloud</h2></div><div class="paper"><p class="instructions">Imagine that you are preparing a project with your friend. You have found some interesting material for the presentation and you want to read this text to your friend. You have 1.5 minutes to read the text silently, then be ready to read it out aloud. You will not have more than 1.5 minutes to read it.</p><p class="reading-text">Crop circles are large patterns created by the flattening of crops such as wheat or barley. These intricate designs, often featuring geometric shapes, appear mysteriously overnight in fields, primarily in Southern England. While some believe they are the result of supernatural forces or extraterrestrial activity, the vast majority are known to be man-made hoaxes. The creation process, called “circle making,” involves teams of people using simple tools like planks and ropes to press down the crops in complex patterns. Despite the known human origins, the phenomenon continues to attract public fascination due to the scale, precision, and secrecy of the creations. The designs have become increasingly elaborate over the years, with some even encoding mathematic formulas. While they cause temporary damage to the crops, they also bring tourists and generate interest in the local areas where they appear.</p><div class="record"><h3>Запись ответа · Task 1</h3><div class="record-buttons"><button class="btn" id="start1">Начать запись</button><button class="btn secondary" id="stop1" disabled>Остановить</button><button class="btn secondary download" id="download1">Скачать MP3</button></div><div class="status" id="status1" aria-live="polite">Запись ещё не начата.</div><audio class="preview" id="preview1" controls></audio></div></div></section>
<section class="task"><div class="task-title"><div class="number">2</div><h2>Task 2 · Asking questions</h2></div><div class="paper"><p class="instructions">Study the advertisement.</p><h3 class="advert-title">Capture the moment: photography course!</h3><img class="advert-image" alt="Capture the moment: photography course" src="data:image/png;base64,"><p class="instructions">You are considering signing up for the photography course and now you’d like to get more information. In 1.5 minutes, you are to ask four direct questions to find out about the following:</p><ol class="question-list"><li>course duration;</li><li>cost of the full course;</li><li>type of camera required;</li><li>if a certificate is provided upon completion.</li></ol><p><strong>You have 20 seconds to ask each question.</strong></p><div class="record"><h3>Запись ответа · Task 2</h3><div class="record-buttons"><button class="btn" id="start2">Начать запись</button><button class="btn secondary" id="stop2" disabled>Остановить</button><button class="btn secondary download" id="download2">Скачать MP3</button></div><div class="status" id="status2" aria-live="polite">Запись ещё не начата.</div><audio class="preview" id="preview2" controls></audio></div></div></section>
<section class="task"><div class="task-title"><div class="number">3</div><h2>Task 3 · Interview</h2></div><div class="paper"><p class="instructions">You are going to give an interview. You have to answer five questions. Give full answers to the questions (2–3 sentences). Remember that you have 40 seconds to answer each question.</p><p class="muted">Вопросы прозвучат в аудиозаписи. После каждого вопроса предусмотрена пауза для ответа. Нажми «Начать интервью и запись», когда будешь готов.</p><audio id="interview" preload="none" src="data:audio/mpeg;base64,"></audio><div class="record"><h3>Запись ответа · Task 3</h3><div class="record-buttons"><button class="btn" id="start3">Начать интервью и запись</button><button class="btn secondary" id="stop3" disabled>Остановить</button><button class="btn secondary download" id="download3">Скачать MP3</button></div><div class="status" id="status3" aria-live="polite">Запись ещё не начата.</div><audio class="preview" id="preview3" controls></audio></div></div></section>
<section class="task"><div class="task-title"><div class="number">4</div><h2>Task 4 · Comparing photos</h2></div><div class="paper"><p class="instructions">Imagine that you and your friend are doing a school project “Urban Mobility”. You have found some photos to illustrate it but for technical reasons you cannot send them now. Leave a voice message to your friend explaining your choice of the photos and sharing some ideas about the project. In 2.5 minutes be ready to:</p><ol class="plan"><li>explain the choice of the illustrations for the project by briefly describing them and noting the differences;</li><li>mention the advantages (1–2) of the two types of transport shown;</li><li>mention the disadvantages (1–2) of the two types of transport shown;</li><li>express your opinion on the subject of the project — which type of transport presented in the pictures you would prefer for a modern city and why.</li></ol><p class="instructions">You will speak for not more than 3 minutes (12–15 sentences). You have to talk continuously.</p><div class="photo-grid"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Photo 1: electric scooter"><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Photo 2: taxi"></div><div class="record"><h3>Запись ответа · Task 4</h3><div class="record-buttons"><button class="btn" id="start4">Начать запись</button><button class="btn secondary" id="stop4" disabled>Остановить</button><button class="btn secondary download" id="download4">Скачать MP3</button></div><div class="status" id="status4" aria-live="polite">Запись ещё не начата.</div><audio class="preview" id="preview4" controls></audio></div></div></section>
<section class="paper"><h2>Твои записи</h2><p>После выполнения заданий скачай все четыре файла и отправь учителю.</p><div id="summary" class="muted">Пока нет готовых записей.</div><div style="margin-top:18px"><button class="btn" id="downloadAll" disabled>Скачать все записи (ZIP)</button><p class="file-note" id="allHint">Кнопка станет доступна после выполнения всех четырёх заданий.</p></div></section><div class="foot">ENGLISH WITH OLGA · Speaking · Тренировочный экзамен № 1</div></main>
